      "supports": "Normas de vestimenta para las rondas preliminares"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "SOR-2026-08-P089-S105",
      "quote": "The following are forbidden at any time: shorter trousers, undressed upper body, any kind of head caps or head covering, jeans, sweaters or similar unrelated sports clothing",
