      "quote": "For the final block program (TV time): formal suit (jacket, trousers, shirt, and tie for men; jacket, trousers/skirt/dress, blouse for women) and formal shoes (no sport shoes or flip-flops)",
      "supports": "Normas de vestimenta para el bloque de finales"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "SOR-2026-08-P089-S105",
      "quote": "Coach positions are provided for each tatami and the coach must remain seated on the chair throughout the contest",
      "supports": "Posición obligatoria del entrenador durante el combate"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "SOR-2026-08-P089-S105",
      "quote": "Coaching is authorised only during the pause after Mate! and before Hajime!",
